      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "To maintain a cohesive and productive workplace, the company must establish a clear policy that prohibits partisan political campaigning or advocacy during work hours or on company property. Employees are free to hold their personal political views, but the workplace must remain a neutral ground for business operations. Any expression that disrupts the work environment or harasses colleagues based on their views should be strictly prohibited and subject to disciplinary action.",
